# Long-form documentation is intentionally NOT packaged: it is ~5 MB of
# screenshots, and the Marketplace rewrites relative README links to the
# repository, so docs/*.md resolve on GitHub instead. (Matches docs/ too —
# vsce path matching is case-insensitive on macOS.)
Docs/**

