# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Release hygiene (2026-08-11 pre-publish audit). Everything below is developer
# material that must never reach a public VSIX: it carries absolute paths from
# the maintainer's machine, internal planning notes, and benchmark artefacts
# with research task titles. None of it is used at runtime.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Unit tests that live beside runtime code (not needed at runtime).
out/extension/nb-import/tests/**
out/extension/kernel/tests/**

# Oberon agent test suites + gold benchmark baselines.
# The baselines embed /Users/<maintainer>/… paths, quest ids and task titles.
out/extension/oberon/tests/**

# Slide/unit test fixtures (golden HTML contains absolute build paths).
test/**

